flowchart LR
  subgraph evaluate [Evaluate step]
    A1[Load AgentSpec version]
    A2[Write agent_spec.json]
    A3[Create run row preclaimed]
    A4[harbor run spec_agent]
    A5[Map rewards to run_tasks]
    A6[Copy traces to artifacts]
    A7[Score mean reward]
    A8[complete_step_and_advance]
    A1 --> A2 --> A3 --> A4 --> A5 --> A6 --> A7 --> A8
  end

  subgraph afterEval [After evaluate]
    B1{Stop?}
    B2[Enqueue improve from best]
    B3[Close job stop_reason]
    B1 -->|no| B2
    B1 -->|yes| B3
  end

  A8 --> B1
